# TARTAN environment configuration.
#
# Every variable here is OPTIONAL. With none of them set the game runs fully
# offline: local saves, local best scores, house ads instead of real ones, and
# a leaderboard that shows only your own runs. That is the intended experience
# for `npm run dev` on a fresh clone.
#
# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in what you have.

# --- Backend (Supabase) ------------------------------------------------------
# Create a project, run supabase/migrations/0001_init.sql, then enable
# anonymous sign-ins under Authentication > Providers.
#
# The anon key is meant to be public — it is shipped in the client bundle, and
# row-level security is what actually protects the data. Never put the
# service_role key here.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# --- Ads (Google AdSense / H5 Games Ads) -------------------------------------
# Your AdSense publisher id, e.g. ca-pub-0000000000000000.
# Leave blank to serve the built-in house ads instead.
VITE_ADSENSE_CLIENT=
